@startuml sequence-withdrawal
title Вывод (withdrawal)

actor "Клиент" as Client
participant "individuals-api" as IA
box "transaction-service" #F5F9FF
    participant "TransactionService" as TS
    participant "WalletService" as WS
    database "БД (шард пользователя)" as DB
    participant "TransactionKafkaProducer" as Pub
    participant "TransactionKafkaConsumer" as Cons
end box
queue "Kafka" as Kafka
participant "Fake Payment Provider" as PP

== init: расчёт условий, в БД ничего не пишется ==
Client -> IA: POST /api/v1/transactions/withdrawal/init
IA -> IA: user_uid из токена
IA -> TS: calc withdrawal conditions (init)
TS -> WS: проверка баланса
WS --> TS: OK, комиссия, доступность
TS --> IA: условия вывода
IA --> Client: условия вывода

== confirm: списание и создание транзакции ==
Client -> IA: POST /api/v1/transactions/withdrawal/confirm
IA -> TS: confirm withdrawal
group одна транзакция БД
    TS -> WS: списать средства (резерв)
    WS -> DB: блокировка кошелька (FOR UPDATE), проверка баланса, Debit
    TS -> DB: транзакция PENDING
    TS -> DB: transaction_events: WithdrawalRequested
end
TS --> IA: status=PENDING, transactionId
IA --> Client: status=PENDING, transactionId

== асинхронно: событие уходит в Fake Payment Provider ==
Pub -> DB: неотправленные записи transaction_events
Pub -> Kafka: WithdrawalRequested (Avro, key = transactionId)
Pub -> DB: запись transaction_events отправлена
Kafka -> PP: WithdrawalRequested
PP -> Kafka: WithdrawalCompleted или WithdrawalFailed

== асинхронно: финализация ==
Kafka -> Cons: WithdrawalCompleted / WithdrawalFailed
alt WithdrawalCompleted
    group одна транзакция БД
        Cons -> DB: статус PENDING → COMPLETED
    end
else WithdrawalFailed
    group одна транзакция БД
        Cons -> DB: статус PENDING → FAILED, failure_reason
        Cons -> WS: вернуть средства
        WS -> DB: Credit
    end
end
note right of Cons
  Статус меняется только из PENDING:
  повторное сообщение ничего не меняет
end note
@enduml
